[b][font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/28.tres]历代荣典[/font][/b]


[indent]•  [color=#000000]唐代武庙六十四将[/color]：唐礼仪使建议追封古代名将六十四人，设庙享奠，邓艾（"魏太尉邓艾"）入列。同期入选者有[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "关羽", "cat": "people"}]关羽[/url][/color]、[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "张飞", "cat": "people"}]张飞[/url][/color]、[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "周瑜", "cat": "people"}]周瑜[/url][/color]、[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "陆逊", "cat": "people"}]陆逊[/url][/color]、[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "吕蒙", "cat": "people"}]吕蒙[/url][/color]等，不足十人。[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]•  [color=#000000]宋代武庙七十二将[/color]：宋真宗依唐代惯例，为七十二名将设庙，邓艾同列。[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]•  [color=#000000]南汉乾亨元年（917年）[/color]：南汉追封邓艾为[color=#000000]彰顺王[/color]。[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]•  [color=#000000]晋泰始九年（273年）[/color]：晋武帝司马炎下诏，"艾有功勋，受罪不逃刑，而子孙为民隶，朕常愍之"，赦免嫡孙邓朗，任为郎中。[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]


